{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker recording every event it tracks, or, given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"consent"},{"type":"text","text":", every event it consents to,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and, given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"samplers"},{"type":"text","text":", the fraction of them they keep."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","text":"Consent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrichers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","text":"Sampler","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingSeed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifie